            "title": "Analysis-Futuristic quantum computing stocks take speculators on roller-coaster ride",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "(Reuters) -Investors in pure-play quantum computing stocks are grappling to value these futuristic companies, making prices highly volatile for the latest hot trend on Wall Street.  Rigetti, IonQ, D\u2011Wave Quantum and Quantum Computing Inc are racing to turn quantum theory into machines that could crack problems beyond the scope of today's computers, possibly assisted by artificial intelligence.  \"All of a sudden, it feels like science fiction has moved into the world of real technological possibility,\" said Sylvia Jablonski, chief investment officer of Defiance ETFs, who oversees the Defiance Quantum fund.",
